--- !u!114 &1626830376
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1626830375}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: c7d59935c57afa94cbf94e1dab9cb126, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::BabysFirst.Rehypothecation.RehypothecationDirector
  lines:
  - id: vo_01_intro
    text: This is Farmer Brown's farm. And this is Farmer Brown's donkey, Andreas. Say hi, Andreas!
    clip: {fileID: 0}
  - id: vo_02_problem
    text: The potatoes are ready! But oh no. Farmer Brown has no wheelbarrow. Farmer Tucker has a wheelbarrow, but no donkey. Can you take Andreas next door?
    clip: {fileID: 0}
  - id: vo_03_collateral
    text: Good sharing! Andreas will stay with Farmer Tucker until the wheelbarrow comes home. That is called collateral. Can you say collateral?
    clip: {fileID: 0}
  - id: vo_04_lets_pick
    text: Now let's pick potatoes! Andreas will be right there when we get back.
    clip: {fileID: 0}
  - id: vo_05_blacksmith
    text: One potato! Farmer Tucker's gate is broken. The blacksmith will fix it, if he can hold on to something nice. Farmer Tucker has something nice! It's Andreas.
    clip: {fileID: 0}
  - id: vo_06_lumberjack
    text: Two potatoes! The blacksmith needs wood for his fire. The lumberjack would like something to hold on to. Guess what the blacksmith has!
    clip: {fileID: 0}
  - id: vo_07_miller
    text: Three potatoes! The lumberjack needs flour. The miller says, is that a donkey?
    clip: {fileID: 0}
  - id: vo_08_city
    text: Four potatoes! The miller owes a man from the city. The man from the city has never seen a donkey. He writes Andreas down in a big book.
    clip: {fileID: 0}
  - id: vo_09_count
    text: Five potatoes! Now five people are counting on one donkey. Let's count the donkeys! One. That's all the donkeys.
    clip: {fileID: 0}
  - id: vo_10_paper
    text: Six potatoes! All done. Nobody is quite sure where Andreas is right now. But everyone has a piece of paper that says he's theirs.
    clip: {fileID: 0}
  - id: vo_11_return
    text: What a good neighbor. Now let's go get Andreas!
    clip: {fileID: 0}
  - id: vo_12_empty
    text: Hmm. Andreas isn't here. That's okay. Andreas is busy.
    clip: {fileID: 0}
  - id: vo_13_economy
    text: This whole time, your donkey Andreas has powered your entire local economy! Wow! So efficient! So collaborative!
    clip: {fileID: 0}
  - id: vo_14_play_more
    text: Want to play more? Try to figure out who owns the donkey if Farmer Brown never returns the wheelbarrow. Or if the donkey retires.
    clip: {fileID: 0}
  voice: {fileID: 0}
  secondsPerWord: 0.36
  minLineSeconds: 2.5
  lingerSeconds: 2
  pencilNote: that is too many!
